Here is the .gitignore file for your project.

Create a file named .gitignore in the root directory of your Hugo project (the same folder where your hugo.toml or hugo.yml lives) and paste the following contents into it:

Plaintext
# OS generated files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# Hugo build directories
/public/
/resources/_gen/
.hugo_build.lock

# Local development environment
.env
